      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, right margin",
          "value": "<p>I owe Ibn [...]. I don\u2019t know what obliged him to give me the supervisio and why he reversed the situation. I had (or: have) already perished from the cheese and was (or: have become) perplexed as to what I should do. Were it not for the \u2018little one\u2019 //being an orphan//, who already has matured and has no one in the world except God,</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
